<title>USA: Tranzonic Cos sets $0.07 shr quarterly.</title>
<headline>Tranzonic Cos sets $0.07 shr quarterly.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tranzonic Cos Inc said it declared a $0.07 per share quarterly dividend on its common stock, payable October 14 to holders of record on September 30.</p>
<p>Previously, Tranzonic had had Class A and Class B common shares, paying dividends on them of $0.05 and $0.09 respectively.</p>
</text>
